**capability.cpp renders controller capabilities as diagnostic text.**

## Interface

`gamepad::unstable::controller::operator<<(ostream&, capabilities) -> ostream&` serializes capability masks via `capabilities::has`.

## Behavior

`operator<<` emits `{}` or `{name, name}` in fixed order: `gyroscope`, `accelerometer`, `touchpad`, `battery`, `microphone-button`, `back-buttons`, `rumble`, `haptics`, `adaptive-triggers`, `light-bar`, `player-leds`; `capability` bits are omitted when unset.